{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51745","headline":"徵青州长老嘲僧门 二 · 杨德辉","name":"徵青州长老嘲僧门 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出家比要离生缘，争是争名更在先。\n说法谩称狮子吼，魅人多使野狐涎（一作禅）。\n行婆饷送新童子，居士抄条施利钱。\n蚕食万民何所用，转教海内有荒田。\n（〖1〗以上二首原作一首，从赵遂之说分爲二首。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨德辉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51745.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51745","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}